---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | DigiiState OS">
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 py-24">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 p-16 rounded-[40px] shadow-sm">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none">
				<p class="text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-12">Last Updated: August 19, 2026</p>
				
				<h3>1. Data Collection</h3>
				<p>We collect lead information (names, phone numbers, inquiry details) specifically to route them to our business partners. We do not sell this data to third-party marketing firms.</p>

				<h3>2. Call Recording</h3>
				<p>Calls generated by our assets are recorded for quality assurance and training purposes. These recordings are accessible to both DigiiState and the active territory partner.</p>

				<h3>3. Security</h3>
				<p>Administrative access to DigiiState OS is restricted to qualified operators using multi-factor authentication and secure protocol keys.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
